# Build context is the console service directory (the parent of deployment/). Keep the per-deploy
# rendered files out of it — .env holds the OIDC client secret, config/ and certs/ are rendered
# per deploy — and keep Cargo's target/ out. The engine would be sent them even when the
# Containerfile never COPYs them. Patterns are relative to the context root. Podman 5.8.2 reads
# this file next to the Containerfile; a Docker host reads it under the same name (unverified).
deployment/.env
deployment/config
deployment/certs
app/target
